# Claude Code artifacts — intentionally tracked.
# .remember/     = session memory (now.md / today-*.md / core-memories.md)
# .claude/       = slash commands + permission allowlist
# These live in the source tree so a re-sync to the publish repo keeps them.

# Client intake records — may contain personal data; not for version control
candidates_horoscope/intake/*
!candidates_horoscope/intake/.gitkeep

